            <ArticleTitle>Relations of pain threshold and pain tolerance in cold water with scores on Maudsley Personality Inventory and Manifest Anxiety Scale.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1155-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Testing 56 Japanese undergraduates, the relationships between pain threshold and pain tolerance in cold water and personality factors were investigated. Significant negative correlations of moderate magnitude between the pain threshold and scores on Maudsley Neuroticism and the Manifest Anxiety Scale were found. On the contrary, significant positive, moderate correlations between pain tolerance and the Maudsley Extraversion were obtained.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
